{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BPROOF is a cooperative multiplayer survival shooter for 1\u20134 players. Explore atmospheric maps, fight challenging enemies, and survive in tense, fast-paced combat. Work together with friends to gather points, unlock areas, and master each map.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some maps include small exploration or puzzle elements, like a Backrooms-inspired level where you search for keys to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1\u20134 player cooperative gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple atmospheric maps with unique challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging AI enemies and tense combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Small exploration or puzzle elements on some maps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progression system with points and unlockable content</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quick, replayable sessions</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Match ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3838660/cd0444234e148ed573fab012a742fbe28800c263.jpg"},{"name":"Killed the First 50s","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3838660/41256a1e0622c027159ffe65adc5ed9b2a676246.jpg"},{"name":"Killed the First 100","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3838660/b0bb3b95651125f7d931659c0a59b6eeb90bad94.jpg"},{"name":"Killed the First 500","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3838660/65e7781312c92a98fc17c33dde666101edb671c0.jpg"},{"name":"Killed the First 1000","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3838660/d3f47ad3987b04b1338ff7d67ffcaf53f27d37d5.jpg"},{"name":"Weaponmen","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3838660/366bbe503ef3cd988bdc2e4e117d619a